'''Zerphi's Last Breath''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Grand Mana Flask}}.

==Mechanics== 
The buff (displayed as flask effect) granted from this flask has the following effect: {{c|help|Last Breath recovers an amount of life per second based on mana cost. It lasts for 4 seconds, but is removed if you are hit.}}
===Aura totems===
Although it is very risky, Zerphi's Last breath can be used with the percentage mana cost of Aura totems to quickly heal, even if the player has [[Blood Magic]].

{{Item acquisition}}

==Legacy variants==
Zerphi's Last Breath has a [[legacy variant]].

{{legacy variant table header}}
{{legacy variant table row|3.2.0|
* 50% increased Charges used
* {{c|mod|Grants Last Breath when you Use a Skill during Flask Effect, for 800% of Mana Cost}}}}
{{Legacy variant table end}}

==Version history==
Until [[version 3.16.0]], this unique was an exclusive drop from [[Perandus chest]]. The whole league mechanic is removed from the game in version 3.16.0, thus all the Perandus leagues unique are added to the core drop pool.

Before the 3.5 rework, the flask was one of the core unique of builds that increase mana cost (e.g. using {{il|Fevered Mind}}), and in turn having a large amount of life recovery from the flask. The rework added the condition that when the character was hit, the flask effect is removed, so that these builds no longer works.
{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.16.0|
* The following Uniques have been added to the core drop pool: Seven-League Step, Umbilicus Immortalis, Trypanon, Varunastra, and Zerphi's Last Breath.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.5.0|
* Now grants a buff when you use a skill during the flask's effect. This buff recovers 450-600% of the skill's mana cost as life per second. This buff (and the healing) is removed when you are hit.
* This affects all versions of the item.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.2.0|
* Now recovers life over 4 seconds instead of instantly. It now heals you for 450-600% of the mana cost, down from 800%. Divining existing versions of Zerphi's Last Breath will set it to these values.
}}
{{Version history table row|2.2.0|
* Introduced to the game.
}}
{{Version history table end}}

